    "file_name": "AFP_ENG_19970406.0166.tml",
    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970406.0166\n\nMOSCOW, April 6 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nTwo killed by avalanche on road in Caucasus\n\n\n\n\nTwo people were killed and two others injured when their car was hit by an avalanche on a main road running through the Russian republic of Northern Ossetia, ITAR-TASS news agency reported Sunday.\n\nSeveral avalanches have hit the region this weekend following the Spring thaw, local official Boris Degoyev said.\n\nHe said traffic has been banned during the day because of the warming temperatures that increase the risk of avalanches.",
